{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8caff6869983a9e3fd3980a4682fa21d6e645241026f6cf66f1b4ac7a3915e89","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"googlecloudplatform/race-condition@26efc1b46743 snapshot b66130ac402fcbca","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1f14e827a6c3430638bc650c09ac27150e622e7ef1728efd823dbe2d3349bbb6","slc_f3ccd907bc62534bf648bffd53657cb7e3d8384c140b42aa40c503ae76c654a1"],"source_ids":["src_71fc3729ed1258809e0018f9b6f9e632","src_cf031869ff5c57a5812245f23f1242f9"],"text":"Agents expose agent cards at /.well-known/agent-card.json; the gateway fetches these cards at startup and routes messages to agents based on their declared skills.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9f22814014385a78cc358b4a1dd40a6278e3de3a7971b5e92ca25fdc57794e03","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"googlecloudplatform/race-condition@26efc1b46743 snapshot b66130ac402fcbca","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9bf29114acfe9b4bada9c8e89962e02c604718476ffd006034ebea507f282b5b","slc_b505f1c41157f78698b4132b2098120f265985f0172ad6ce574842d17977ae37"],"source_ids":["src_cf031869ff5c57a5812245f23f1242f9"],"text":"The frontend boots in Cached mode by default, replaying NDJSON streams recorded from real agent runs so demos do not depend on live LLM calls or the network; Live mode instead talks to agents over WebSockets.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a7adb9593037b46708b9de4fb2ac935cca4bc2cdede2093b45f3f8b6df7b7095","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"googlecloudplatform/race-condition@26efc1b46743 snapshot b66130ac402fcbca","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_21f8784f70f69cd832d564a88c0f35343a24ffb0511702a3ccf1ef4555f2012c"],"source_ids":["src_cf031869ff5c57a5812245f23f1242f9"],"text":"The project is a multi-agent marathon simulation built with Google ADK and Gemini in which agents plan a Las Vegas marathon route, simulate weather, traffic, and crowds, and run the race autonomously, communicating over the A2A protocol.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a"}
