{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ab19ed864feca7698f70ff936321f1e86841a9a3008d1abd9dac9a9b2abad6f8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"googlecloudplatform/race-condition@26efc1b46743 snapshot b66130ac402fcbca","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2be368ee9f52def9885fcf0f9be0bac23add654710acc137f00e9a3567bddf3d"],"source_ids":["src_cf031869ff5c57a5812245f23f1242f9"],"text":"The planner ships in three variants: a base planner, one adding LLM-as-Judge evaluation, and one adding AlloyDB-backed route memory; the simulator runs a tick-based pipeline and spawns runner agents, which come in LLM-powered and deterministic autopilot variants.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:55:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64308dbc2b004dc5a6b2f4885ba03f2a"}
